> and hope both major problems are cured? Or should I try to pray before
> hunger reaches a major problem?

The most obvious way to remove the ring of levitation other than
uncursing it is to find a sink, and levitate over it.  Note, this will
hurt a little.

Magic traps are another option (5% chance of uncursing).

If you don't have any sinks left, you can explode the ring, if you
have a source of lightning.  Note, this may explode any and all other
rings and wands in inventory (other than wands of lightning and rings
of shock resistance), so be prepared to drop all zappable items you
don't want blown up.

From a prayer standpoint, you are probably safest waiting until nearly
fainting, eat some cursed food until you are only hungry, then pray,
while wielding some of of your cursed food.  If cursed levitation is
your only(major) problem, it should be fixed if your god is not
unhappy.  You MAY get a benefit by levitating over the altar while
praying, but I don't remember if this is true or not.

Check the prayer spoiler - http://www.steelypips.org/nethack/pray.html

